  "body": "Main is red since the merge of PR #2833 (`17b1b2b81`, issue #2400).\n\nWhat happens: `cargo test -p xtask` fails one test.\n\n```\ngate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app --- FAILED\nsuites without a Gate map: [\"corner_relief\", \"corner_relief_safety\", \"corner_relief_serialization\"]\n```\n\nCause: the new suites `crates/app/tests/corner_relief.rs`, `corner_relief_safety.rs` and `corner_relief_serialization.rs` have a Provenance line but no `Gate map:` line. The quick tier cannot select them from a change to the modules they test.\n\nFound by the M5 main-health check (last green `5fdbed9bd`, red `17b1b2b81`); reproduced on `17b1b2b81`.\n\nDone means: each of the three suites has a `Gate map:` line that names the app modules it covers, and `cargo test -p xtask` passes on main.\n",
